  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1137038/description_530cc8c0-0350-4c3d-8d1a-143865960a29.png\">進食動畫模組，現在以材質包形式呈現！</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始進食動畫模組</a></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1137038/description_d2856b0f-33ec-4d94-9feb-de61899fd289.png\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">一款為可食用與可飲用物品添加精靈動畫的材質包。</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1473/245/0118-3-gif.gif\" alt=\"展示\"></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1137038/description_76c598ab-7f5c-4125-a6b5-2268b2dce6af.png\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">只需下載並選擇此材質包，現在你無需模組也能擁有動態食物效果 :)</span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1137038/description_2d799e80-23b9-410b-83be-7c3016821928.PNG\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1137038/description_ca5a3fc7-2c1a-4659-ad1a-80a1e7ade821.png\"></p>",
